### Feature Modules (`apps/api/src/modules/`)

#### Authentication (`auth/`)

JWT-based authentication with Passport:

- **auth.controller.ts** - Auth endpoints (login, signup, verify, reset password)
- **auth.service.ts** - Authentication business logic
- **auth.module.ts** - Auth module configuration
- **decorators/** - Auth decorators (current-user, roles, auth-options)
- **roles.decorator.ts** - Simple role check decorator (`@Roles('tenant_admin')`)
- **guards/** - JWT guards (access/refresh tokens)
- **roles.guard.ts** - Simple role verification guard (use with `@Roles()` decorator)
- **strategies/** - Passport JWT strategies (identity/tenant tokens)
- **dto/** - Auth DTOs (login, signup, forgot-password, etc.)

